// Site design photos + logos, embedded as base64 text (same pattern as
// designImageAssets.js — the GitHub snapshot push accepts text only, and
// loose files read via fs are not bundled into the serverless function).
// appAssetRoutes serves these at /design-img/<file> with immutable cache
// headers. They used to be embedded in the CLIENT bundle as data URIs,
// which made every page parse ~1 MB of base64 before first paint
// (Abdullah's slow-reload complaint, 2026-11-17) — as real image URLs
// they download in parallel and stay cached between visits.
